Attribution: Leah Childers

The music: P03's first two bars (the pickup and the first full bar) are from "Adeste Fideles" ("O Come All Ye
Faithful"), arranged by Samuel Webbe (public domain). P04's first four bars are a short march opening written for
testing this project. Everything else was written by the Neurallegro model.
